  "source_boundary": "Pinned PBPS2609.06905v1 C.1 smoothcompact reduction physical4573–4576, literal S density4581–4587 and actual mean4597–4604, C.2 integrated actual gradient4654–4664 toward B.13 physical3777–3786. This is source-specific analytic integration of the compact branch, not printed full rough B.13.",
  "source_extension": "Finite real Hilbert/Borel E including rank0 is explicit authored extension of source Euclidean setting. Original C2 V, signed smoothcompact f, two-sided Hessian and beta*eta<=1 retained exactly. G is repository compact-gradient LinearPMap core with exact smoothcompact AE graph; closure interpretation is explicit authored background, not a claim of proved equivalence to any independently defined weighted weak H1.",
  "actual_objects": "Exact μ=volume.tilted(-V), SAME J=law(X,X+sqrt(eta)G), actual ν=J.snd, literal source S_y=volume.tilted(-V((y+u)/2)-norm(y-u)^2/(8eta)), Tf(y)=actual source S_y mean. Uniform G chosen BEFORE all smoothcompact f; produced hTf/hGrad toLp are canonical classes in the SAME ν and true G.closure.graph. G is distinct from50 lower-right blockD.",
  "consumer": "Actual50 macroscopic Ag representative equals literal Tf after exact every-y S transport. Compact Tf now has true closed-gradient graph pair, needed before source density/closedness passage for all-L2 B.13. No compact support of Tf is assumed.",
